# **/ prefixes matter: COPY . . must never overwrite the node_modules the
# image just installed with the host's (platform-specific symlink) copies.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/out
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.ai
.claude
.vercel
local
tasks
docs/prds
docs/adds
docs/decisions
